      "writtenOn": "2023-08-09T21:00:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, but then the test wouldn\u0027t function correctly upon a second run of no_debugger. For example, it would then fail if you did:\n\n1. **power cycle the board (if you flashed using debugger or already ran test)**\n1. runtest no_debugger\n1. runtest debugger\n1. FAIL--\u003e runtest no_debugger\n\nOne could argue that this mechanism doesn\u0027t belong in this test, but the counter argument is that we already have a lot of other tests that require external sequencing and environment setup. I tried to document the nuance of how this test MUST be performed above.",
